| R-01 | Unauthorized access to confidential customer data | Azure Storage | Medium (2) | High (3) | High (6) | Entra ID, RBAC, Private Endpoint, Encryption | TBD |

## R-01 Risk Justification

**Likelihood:** Medium — Credential theft and excessive permissions could allow unauthorized access.

**Impact:** High — Exposure of confidential financial data could cause financial loss, compliance issues, and damage to customer trust.

**Inherent Risk Score:** 2 × 3 = 6 (High).

**Residual Risk:** To be assessed after evaluating the effectiveness of existing controls.

| R-02 | Excessive user permissions could allow unauthorized changes or deletion of Azure resources | Azure resource group and cloud resources | Medium (2) | High (3) | High (6) | Entra ID security group, Azure RBAC Reader role | Medium (3) — provisional |

## R-02 Risk Justification

**Likelihood:** Medium (2) — Administrators may accidentally assign excessive permissions during user onboarding or access changes.

**Impact:** High (3) — Excessive permissions could allow unauthorized modification or deletion of important Azure resources.

**Inherent Risk Score:** 2 × 3 = 6 (High).

**Existing Controls:** Microsoft Entra security group GRP-Azure-Employees and Azure RBAC Reader role assigned at the resource group scope.

**Residual Risk:** Medium (3) — Provisionally estimated as Low likelihood (1) × High impact (3), assuming the intended role assignments are effective. Administrative mistakes and other privileged assignments remain possible.

**Verification Needed:** Review IAM role assignments on rg-azure-grc-lab and confirm that GRP-Azure-Employees has Reader access.


| R-03 | Failure to alert on suspicious Azure activity | Azure monitoring and incident detection | Medium (2) | High (3) | High (6) | Azure Activity Logs, Log Analytics, Microsoft Sentinel, enabled resource deletion analytics rule | Pending alert test |

## R-03 Risk Justification

**Existing Controls:** Azure Activity Logs forwarded to Log Analytics, Microsoft Sentinel connected, and an enabled scheduled analytics rule to detect successful Azure resource deletion operations.

**Residual Risk:** Pending alert test. Log ingestion and rule configuration have been verified, but successful alert generation has not yet been demonstrated.

**Verification Needed:** Generate a controlled matching test event and confirm that Sentinel creates the expected alert or incident.
